@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sách bài tập -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ -> 201 Created + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. GET đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo (bấm lại sau 1s và 3s thấy received -> processing -> graded) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu (studentCode / repositoryUrl rỗng) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bài tập không tồn tại (id = 999) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 7. GET lượt nộp với ID không tồn tại -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bắt tay SignalR negotiate đúng đường dẫn -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Bắt tay SignalR negotiate sai đường dẫn -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1